<title>USA: UNIVERSAL GETS PRIMESTAR CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSAL GETS PRIMESTAR CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>TWINSBURG, Ohio 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Electronics Inc on Friday said that it has received a contract to supply up to two million remote control units to Primestar, the digital television entertainment service.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Universal, which makes universal remote controls for home video and audio equipment, is expected to ship the orders during the next 18 months.</p>
<p>Primestar will market the remote control under the name of PrimeFinder.</p>
</text>
